# Dark Samus helpers2 coverage driver: the rooftop fight (Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop, layer 2,
# boss u04f7). The steps are the ones the lane's own drivers use (tools/drivers/darksamus_*.con):
# activate the boss, put the player next to it, hit it with the missiles and with direct damage,
# then force the FSM2 states one after the other so their helpers run.
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f700 place u04f7 player 3
@f720 give missile 90
@f740 aim -2 0
@f760 press Y 45
